 "headline": "“WHAT A PERFECT KICK-OFF TO THE HOLIDAY SEASON” - Michele Boyd",
 "intro": "TO CELEBRATE MARVEL STUDIOS’ GUARDIANS OF THE GALAXY HOLIDAY SPECIAL, IHC PRODUCED AN IMMERSIVE PRE-SCREENING AND CURATED A JAM-PACKED GUESTLIST!",
