   ],
   "html": "<p>IHC brought the holiday spirit to Disney with a festive screening that hosted nearly 200 cultural tastemakers, social influencers, and VIPs for a night to remember. We decked out the main theater in Neuehouse with a spectacular array of holiday decor, including vibrant lighting and a 4D poster-recreation photo booth. </p>\n<p>Immediately after the screening, the band, Black Crystal Wolf Kids, treated guests to holiday classic covers, including two original songs from the film, ending with a surprise snowstorm moment queued by Mariah Carey’s “All I Want For Christmas Is You.”</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "‘Tis The Season for decor",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>We drew inspiration from scenes within the special, bringing Mantis’ vision of Peter Quill’s perfect Christmas to life. Neuehouse was transformed into a Winter Wonderland of Guardians cheer, combining traditional holiday decor with animatronics. </p>",
     "right": "<p>Special attention to detail was considered at every corner of the event as guests enjoyed warm holiday-themed signature cocktails served by bartenders decked out in Christmas attire while dancing under a string of vibrant lights!</p>"
    },
