  {
   "title": "VIP Guestlist",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>We curated a guestlist of creators, actors, musicians, and all around Marvel enthusiasts to join in on the fun! The result was 200+ attendees including talent and film fanatics. Guardians of the Galaxy stars Pom Klementieff and Sean Gunn made a surprise appearance to introduce the screening. </p>",
     "right": "<p>The Rose, Ben Lee, Ione Skye, Anna Lilly Amanpour, Reese Feldman, Leah Lamar, Jarry Lee, Andre Hyland, Kyle Ng, and Khleo Thomas were among the many who joined the special evening. The Cobrasnake was on hand to capture all the magic as well and help create lasting memories. </p>"
