  {
   "title": "PHOTO MOMENT",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>We produced an epic 4D photo experience alongside our partner, Tommy B, so guests could recreate the Holiday Special’s poster with a fun takeaway to remember the evening. </p>",
     "right": "<p>Created out of a mix of practical set pieces and digital overlays, fans stepped up to pose in front of a brick wall on a sidewalk, while a passed-out Drax and Mantis were photoshopped into the frame. </p>"
